{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-marea-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"marea-residences-sharafi-development-dubai-islands","about":"Marea Residences by Sharafi Development introduces a sophisticated waterfront lifestyle within the prestigious Dubai Islands community. The development features an exclusive collection of semi-furnished 1 and 2-bedroom apartments together with expansive 2 and 3-bedroom duplex residences complete with maid’s rooms, private terraces, plunge pools, and spa-inspired bathrooms. The architecture draws inspiration from the natural rhythm of ocean waves, creating fluid balconies, open layouts, and panoramic island-facing views.Residents experience hotel-inspired living with premium European appliances, curated finishes, landscaped surroundings, an infinity pool, wellness facilities, sauna, Turkish hammam, and elegant social lounges. Located in the beachfront district of Dubai Islands A, Marea Residence Dubai enjoys direct proximity to beaches, luxury hotels, promenades, and retail attractions while remaining exceptionally connected to Jumeirah, Downtown Dubai, DIFC, and Dubai International Airport. The project balances tranquil island living with strong long-term investment appeal in Dubai Islands real estate.","price":2740000,"title":"Marea Residences","bitrix":{"id":1507,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Dubai Islands A","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Marea Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Sharafi Development","project_location":"Dubai Islands "},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Feature_bdff5c3c70.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Feature_bdff5c3c70.webp"}],"status":null,"_geoloc":{"lat":25.300763813589,"lng":55.300951998039},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_8_d40e429101.